<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-13T01:59:48.441Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:59:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard and the Bureau of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources completed a high seas boarding and inspection mission aboard BRP Teresa Magbanua, while the Armed Forces of the Philippines spokesperson reiterated the Philippines is standing up for its rights in the West Philippine Sea. A Chinese survey ship entered Scarborough Shoal, prompting Manila to summon the Chinese ambassador, and China’s coast guard continued patrolling waters around Diaoyu Dao. The PCG rescued 29 passengers and crew from a distressed boat in Palawan and suspended sea travel there because of rough seas, and an LCT sank off Surigao del Sur spilling about 800 liters of oil along 200 meters of shoreline. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNaHc2STJCTm9sRGhPZFdJRGNTcDZzdG1fdEJva0cyWk9hTFF2RFB1cnQ2Y0tZX3hzVnRMMm5ic1J4bWJTWGc0MEFvTmEwRzRyYmE4bHVtcFlqYWxpaUNmSjRJR3hJVXVYcUVCZGY2MS1XM2p0N09XM1NKdmxGa3U0ZHNQREdsVmNQdlRsSDNrTEtPdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNMWhMOG9ocGk1bzVHM25rUEctQm1sVWt4ODdVSGQzLXdmUGMzR0YyWkZ5WjRQWWhNTG1BRmhGS3BiZGh6ZDU1cWpwaFFCRWd1MzFhdTBkeGtqdmZNRW1uazJRWnJmV2I0X2lpQ1JfdWt6Z3lKaTBLOXk2b3RaN2pBUngzNlNpZFIwSnAwMzVaUUwtM3NRMml6bA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Maritime Executive&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPc0hzejB6Ry1ieFF6NmM4YXZJN2lqWTBVR2xlZWk1Z201SEhybXhfVC1rZi1Dd05JZUQzazVwTFdyS0FwWkdlVjZhNEUyd0VfaUtKX3NFVDF5UWplVGFIQnRNYlRVSXQ3cTVGOUItaTRlMzRFcW5VUGE3M3FCYkJsVGJ0dG1OalJxbGtkYXdRSUthWVN2ZEl5b18yLVYwdGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lowy Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFBFRX